# This repo is edited from a Windows box with core.autocrlf=true. Force LF in
# the working tree so the launcher scripts (run, run.sh, run.py, lint, search,
# setup.*) keep Unix line endings and run on macOS/Linux. Windows .bat stays CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary